      "prompt": "Image 1 is a sticker of a small fishing boat; image 2 is its cut-out puppet pieces. Draw one more piece for the puppet, in exactly the same drawing style, colours, texture and line: a single length of the same tan twisted rope as the boat's rigging ropes and the net's rope in images 1 and 2, the same thickness as those ropes at the size they have in image 1, hanging perfectly straight and vertical down the middle of the sheet, from near the top edge to near the bottom edge, with plain ends. Only the rope: nothing tied to it, no knots, no loops, no coils. No text, no labels, no numbers, no shadows, no water. Fully transparent background."
    }
